[resource]
script = ExtResource("2_7aqtd")
letter_id = 270
description = "[font_size=32](3/3)

“SLIM!” I yelled, after a second with my jaw on the floor, realizing if the first shot hit the bottle it would’ve hit him too. He was still sitting there confidently. That’s when I saw him pulling a flask out of his breast pocket, a bullet lodged in the metal. 

“What’s I tell you kid? The house always wins.” I looked at the cards on the table. “Read ‘em and weep,” he said. A royal flush. “Shame about your drink though kid.” He reached into a cabinet behind him before setting a bottle of “Old Hare Original” on the table. “Unlike that, this one hasn’t been aged seventy years past its prime. Come back any time you feel like a drink and good talk.”"
letter_format = ExtResource("1_74gym")
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://gbihjja6jybk"
